DAT
id=qid::label=str::text=lstr::
43225::$$$message_0364_0000_0000$$$::Let us turn back time to just over half a year ago.[lr]::
43226::$$$message_0364_0000_0001$$$::This is a tale from another world, of the birth of a Servant and Master, and their friendship.[p][nolr]::
43227::$$$message_0364_0000_0002$$$::Heed my words.::
43228::$$$message_0364_0000_0003$$$::My will creates your body, and your sword creates my destiny.::
43229::$$$message_0364_0000_0004$$$::If you heed the Grail's call and abide by this will and reason, then answer me!::
43230::$$$message_0364_0000_0005$$$::I hereby swear...::
43231::$$$message_0364_0000_0006$$$::You who guards the three words of power,::
43232::$$$message_0364_0000_0007$$$::come forth from the circle of binding, Guardian of the Scales!::
43233::$$$message_0364_0000_0008$$$::"Ahhhh, I'm falling!"[nolr][p]::
43234::$$$message_0364_0000_0009$$$::"...Mmnargh. I'm a dual-wielder starting today, so I wouldn't mind having both gold and silver."::
43235::$$$message_0364_0000_0010$$$::"Mmnyargh... I don't care about any tiger-striped sword. Hurry up and hand it over, loli goddess[wvs][move textoff=0 opacity=255 cx=298 layer=2 py=116 px=488 affine=(489,149,1.848,1,255,298,77)(487,211,9.782,1,255,298,77)(496,447,19.537,1,255,298,77)(500,477,-21.161,1,255,298,77)(549,362,-79.992,1,255,298,77)(782,328,-115.201,1,255,298,77)(854,434,-206.866,1,255,298,77)(893,498,-270,1,255,298,77) time=1000 cy=78 mag=1 deg=+0.0 accel=3 spline=1][move opacity=255 textoff=0 base=hf_ブルマイリヤ-ガーン cx=97 layer=0 py=115 px=134 affine=(166,205,-120,1,255,88,88)(167,354,-360,1,255,88,88)(155,404,-500,1,255,88,88)(155,405,-700,1,255,88,88)(135,406,-900,1,255,88,88)(155,407,-1200,1,255,88,88)(138,353,0,1,255,88,88)(128,341,10,1,150,88,88)(120,351,30,1,255,88,88)(114,364,100,1,255,88,88)(112,382,160,1,255,88,88) time=800 cy=78 mag=1 deg=+0.0 accel=0 spline=1 both=1][sestop storage=se348.wav time=500 nowait=true][se storage=se086.wav][wait canskip=0 time=800][quake vmax=50 hmax=50 time=2000][se storage=se230.wav][se storage=se436.wav][se storage=se152.wav][se storage=se115.wav][fadein textoff=0 noclear=1 time=200 rule=円形(中から外へ) vague=200 storage=爆発a]::
43236::$$$message_0364_0000_0011$$$::[line len=2]BLARGH!?"[wait canskip=0 time=1000][stopmove]::
43237::$$$message_0364_0001_0000$$$::"Is this some n-n-newfangled natural disaster!?"::
43238::$$$message_0364_0002_0000$$$::"A pair of gym shorts appeared out of thin air and drop-kicked me in the solar plexus!"::
43239::$$$message_0364_0003_0000$$$::"Uh... Sorry about that. I messed up.[lr]::
43240::$$$message_0364_0003_0001$$$::[hffacechg chara=藤ねえ face=うーん layer=1 left=7 top=397 time=200][hfsweat layer=1]I came flying because someone called, but I tripped on my feet when I got here."::
43241::$$$message_0364_0003_0002$$$::"Still, I should thank you.[lr]::
43242::$$$message_0364_0003_0003$$$::Thanks for breaking my fall, meat cushion."::
43243::$$$message_0364_0003_0004$$$::"Hm, I don't really get it but it was my geschehen."::
43244::$$$message_0364_0004_0000$$$::"Who woulda thought the freak falling from the sky was such a polite little girl in gym shorts?"::
43245::$$$message_0364_0004_0001$$$::"Don't call me 'meat cushion' again, though.[lr]::
43246::$$$message_0364_0004_0002$$$::Actually, you're not polite at all!"::
43247::$$$message_0364_0004_0003$$$::"Ow! That hurts, [hfchance pos=upper][l][say storage=HSTR1_BIR_0080 _name=ブルマイリヤ]let me go, ouch, my head's gonna split, [l][say storage=HSTR1_BIR_0090 _name=ブルマイリヤ][hfchance pos=upper]it's gonna crack open![hfstopquake layer=message0]"[nolr]::
43248::$$$message_0364_0005_0000$$$::"Oh, I get it! You're a gorilla!"::
43249::$$$message_0364_0005_0001$$$::"Horses and dragons are such old-fashioned steeds, but you're part of the new wave! The Gorilla Rider!"::
43250::$$$message_0364_0005_0002$$$::"Oh god, just kill me now![lr]::
43251::$$$message_0364_0005_0003$$$::I don't want to team up with an embarrassing Servant like that!"::
43252::$$$message_0364_0005_0004$$$::"Eeek! I don't wanna fight something like that either![lr]::
43253::$$$message_0364_0005_0005$$$::...Hold on."::
43254::$$$message_0364_0005_0006$$$::"What Servant?[lr]::
43255::$$$message_0364_0005_0007$$$::You're the one who got summoned. Doesn't that make you the Servant?"::
43256::$$$message_0364_0005_0008$$$::"What are you talking about? I was invited here as a Master. There was an open position, so they asked me to fill it as a mage."::
43257::$$$message_0364_0005_0009$$$::"Wait, I thought I summoned the Servant I wanted on the way over, but..."::
43258::$$$message_0364_0005_0010$$$::"Um... (looks around)"::
43259::$$$message_0364_0005_0011$$$::"Uhh... (head on a swivel)"::
43260::$$$message_0364_0005_0012$$$::"Nobody else is here.[lr]::
43261::$$$message_0364_0005_0013$$$::It only goes to reason that you're my Servant."[wm canskip=0]::
43262::$$$message_0364_0005_0014$$$::"That's nonsense![lr]::
43263::$$$message_0364_0005_0015$$$::Preposterous! Are you telling me to serve this little girl, O gods of Babylonia!?"::
43264::$$$message_0364_0005_0016$$$::"...Wouldn't it paint a better picture if I was the Master and the little girl was the Servant?"::
43265::$$$message_0364_0005_0017$$$::"Umm, that might've flown a century ago."::
43266::$$$message_0364_0005_0018$$$::"But now, we live in an age of degeneracy.[lr]::
43267::$$$message_0364_0005_0019$$$::They say that the small ruling the big is first-rate moe. You get me?"::
43268::$$$message_0364_0005_0020$$$::"Hrmm, an old bat like me can't keep up with you young'uns."::
43270::$$$message_0364_0005_0022$$$::"I can't get a read on your age.[lr]::
43271::$$$message_0364_0005_0023$$$::Don't tell me there's a hatch on your back that a sly old fox might emerge from."::
43272::$$$message_0364_0005_0024$$$::"...Do I look like a theme park mascot to you?"::
43273::$$$message_0364_0005_0025$$$::"You're not completely wrong, I guess.[lr]::
43274::$$$message_0364_0005_0026$$$::Neither of us are the type to fight head-on, so why don't you just behave and obey me?"::
43275::$$$message_0364_0005_0027$$$::"Me aside, you're the kind of person who has to live by finding the weirdest angles to attack."::
43276::$$$message_0364_0005_0028$$$::"You've got that right.[lr]::
43277::$$$message_0364_0005_0029$$$::...You're pretty persuasive, despite that baby face."::
43278::$$$message_0364_0006_0000$$$::"Y'know, I'm starting to feel like you're the Master, too."::
43279::$$$message_0364_0006_0001$$$::"I'm glad you agree.[lr]::
43280::$$$message_0364_0006_0002$$$::Let's introduce ourselves, then. I'm Illyasviel. [l][say storage=HSTR1_BIR_0300 _name=ブルマイリヤ][hffacechg chara=ブルマイリヤ face=楽3 layer=0 time=200]You can call me Illya for short."::
43281::$$$message_0364_0006_0003$$$::"What about you? You could just tell me your class, but what's your True Name?"::
43282::$$$message_0364_0006_0004$$$::"Hm. Hmmm. [l][hffacechg chara=藤ねえ face=うーん layer=1 time=200][hfsweat layer=1][hfquake layer=message1 wait=0 hmax=3 vmax=4][say storage=HSTR1_TIG_0260 _name=藤ねえ]Hmmmmmm."::
43283::$$$message_0364_0006_0005$$$::"Wait a minute, don't tell me..."::
43284::$$$message_0364_0006_0006$$$::"Indeed. I don't remember a thing. But I'm sure my class is Sa...ber...?[lr]::
43285::$$$message_0364_0006_0007$$$::And my specialty weapon is...feminine charms...?"::
43286::$$$message_0364_0006_0008$$$::"No way. You're not Saber, nor are you charming."::
43287::$$$message_0364_0006_0009$$$::"You're such a mean Master, Illya![lr]::
43288::$$$message_0364_0006_0010$$$::Don't you believe your own Servant!?"::
43290::$$$message_0364_0006_0012$$$::"I one-hundred percent believe that you [font italic=true]are[font italic=false] a Servant."::
43291::$$$message_0364_0006_0013$$$::"But I don't know what you can do, yet.[lr]::
43292::$$$message_0364_0006_0014$$$::I'll trust you once I know what abilities my Heroic Spirit has."::
43293::$$$message_0364_0006_0015$$$::"Do you really not remember anything? Not even your name?"::
43294::$$$message_0364_0007_0000$$$::"That's pretty unbelievable... Usually people say that to gloss over something they don't want to explain."::
43295::$$$message_0364_0007_0001$$$::"Oof. You've got an ice-cold eye for observation."::
43296::$$$message_0364_0007_0002$$$::"But...[l][hfchance layer=1][say storage=HSTR1_TIG_0340 _name=藤ねえ]but I really don't know! I'd like to know what class I am, too!"::
43297::$$$message_0364_0007_0003$$$::"Huh, so you don't even know which Servant you are. ...Hehe, how interesting. I'm looking forward to seeing you figure it out."::
43298::$$$message_0364_0007_0004$$$::"You know? Then tell me.[lr]::
43299::$$$message_0364_0007_0005$$$::[hffacechg chara=藤ねえ face=まったく2 layer=1 time=200][hfsigh layer=1]It doesn't really matter what class I am, but knowing it would make me feel better."::
43300::$$$message_0364_0007_0006$$$::"Nope! Everything has to follow equivalent exchange.[lr]::
43301::$$$message_0364_0007_0007$$$::[hffacechg chara=ブルマイリヤ face=ふっ time=200][hfstamp layer=0]I'll tell you once you tell me what you're hiding. I'll tell your very flesh and blood."::
43302::$$$message_0364_0007_0008$$$::"Kuh! Those devilish charms won't work on me, you little hellion!"::
43303::$$$message_0364_0007_0009$$$::"I-I'm not hiding anything, really![lr]::
43304::$$$message_0364_0007_0010$$$::I remember my True Name, but I'm keeping it secret because I totally plan to betray you!"::
43305::$$$message_0364_0007_0011$$$::"..."::
43306::$$$message_0364_0007_0012$$$::"Oh [wvs][hfchance layer=1][say storage=HSTR1_TIG_0430 _name=藤ねえ]crap, I said the quiet part out loud!"::
43307::$$$message_0364_0007_0013$$$::"But being too honest to keep secrets is a tiny virtue, too, so my Master can rest easy![heart]"::
43308::$$$message_0364_0007_0014$$$::"...You really are an honest Servant."::
43309::$$$message_0364_0007_0015$$$::"All right, I'll make sure to reserve one Command Spell. My last order will be to make you run around a tree for the rest of your life.[humming]"::
43310::$$$message_0364_0007_0016$$$::"Eek![whitestar] That's just like my Master to respond to dark jokes with more dark humor. So reassuring."::
43311::$$$message_0364_0007_0017$$$::"Gahhh, I'll make you use all of them up if it's the last thing I do."::
43312::$$$message_0364_0007_0018$$$::"...Go ahead. That's what it means to be Master and Servant, anyway."::
43313::$$$message_0364_0007_0019$$$::"Still, if I don't know your name, I won't know what to call you, never mind come up with strategies. Do you at least remember the fighting style you're good at, or anything like that?"::
43314::$$$message_0364_0007_0020$$$::"Hmm. If I had to say, it's Tora.[lr]::
43315::$$$message_0364_0007_0021$$$::Yeah, you can call me the Tora Servant!"::
43316::$$$message_0364_0007_0022$$$::"Tora? Oh, like a tiger? I'll just call you Taiga, then."::
43317::$$$message_0364_0007_0023$$$::"Gah! Why are you switching to Japanese!?[lr]::
43318::$$$message_0364_0007_0024$$$::You're German, so at least say 'der tiger' like a German would!"::
43319::$$$message_0364_0007_0025$$$::"Taiga's shorter and sweeter. Remember what I said about the small ruling the big?"::
43320::$$$message_0364_0008_0000$$$::"Let's go, Taiga. First, we need to report to the church as agreed."::
43321::$$$message_0364_0008_0001$$$::"Waaaaah![lr]::
43322::$$$message_0364_0008_0002$$$::Don't call me Taiga!!!"[nolr][p]::
43323::$$$message_0364_0008_0003$$$::"I see.[lr]::
43324::$$$message_0364_0008_0004$$$::So we just need to beat the other six teams?"::
43325::$$$message_0364_0008_0005$$$::"Yeah. The other Masters each have stars, so we need to defeat them and take the stars for ourselves."::
43326::$$$message_0364_0008_0006$$$::"The Holy Grail will appear to the team who has all seven stars and grant our wish."::
43327::$$$message_0364_0008_0007$$$::"I-[l][hfchance layer=1][say storage=HSTR1_TIG_0570 _name=藤ねえ]incredible... So you mean if we get the Holy Grail, it won't be a pipe dream to get our own routes!?"::
43328::$$$message_0364_0008_0008$$$::"Of course! You can be a school heroine, a murder mystery heroine, or even a world domination heroine! It's all in the palm of your hand!"::
43329::$$$message_0364_0008_0009$$$::"...Heh. Sounds like our wishes align, Taiga. I'm sure we weren't each other's first choice, but why don't we work toward a shared goal for now?"::
43330::$$$message_0364_0008_0010$$$::"We'll be of one mind and body until we get the Holy Grail. No lie in that!"::
43331::$$$message_0364_0008_0011$$$::"Hehehe. Just until we get the Holy Grail, that is!"::
43332::$$$message_0364_0008_0012$$$::"Yes, of course. There's only one Holy Grail, after all."[nolr][p]::
43333::$$$message_0364_0008_0013$$$::"All right, let's do this! [l][hfchance layer=1][say storage=HSTR1_TIG_0620 _name=藤ねえ]The goal: a utopia just for us!"::
43334::$$$message_0364_0008_0014$$$::"No arguments from me! [hfchance layer=0][lr]::
43335::$$$message_0364_0008_0015$$$::We'll clear out anyone who gets in our way!"::
43336::$$$message_0364_0009_0000$$$::"Hehe."[nolr][p]::
43337::$$$message_0364_0009_0001$$$::"Hehehe." [nolr][p][say storage=HSTR1_TWP_0000 _name=ブルマイリヤと藤ねえ][textspeed mul=0.4][hfu][cm][texton]"[hfl]"[hfu]He[hfl]He[hfu]he[hfl]he[hfu]he[hfl]he[hfu]he[hfl]he[hfu]he[hfl]he[hfu]he[hfl]he[hfu]he[hfl]he[hfu]he[hfl]he[hfu]he[hfl]he[hfu]he[hfl]he[hfu]he[hfl]he[hfu]...[hfl]...[hfu]...[hfl]...[hfu]...[hfl]...[hfu]...[hfl]...[hfu]![hfl]![hfu]![hfl]![hfu]![hfl]![hfu]![hfl]![hfu]![hfl]![hfu]"[hfl]"[textspeed][nolr][p]::
43338::$$$message_0364_0009_0002$$$::"Anyway, Taiga and I will be entering as a team."::
43339::$$$message_0364_0010_0000$$$::"We have Command Spells and a Servant, so surely there isn't a problem."::
43340::$$$message_0364_0010_0001$$$::"...It is not my place to say.[lr]::
43341::$$$message_0364_0010_0002$$$::The Servants are already gathered, and there are always exceptions to every rule."::
43342::$$$message_0364_0010_0003$$$::"Very well. If you seek the Holy Grail, then use your wish to devour the others' wishes."::
43343::$$$message_0364_0010_0004$$$::"Huh? Have our wish eat the others?[lr]::
43344::$$$message_0364_0010_0005$$$::Um, I thought you're supposed to beat up other people in a Holy Grail War. Whatcha talkin' bout, Shaggy?"::
43345::$$$message_0364_0010_0006$$$::"Is that a new speech tic?[lr]::
43346::$$$message_0364_0010_0007$$$::Shaggy... It's not to my taste, but it might suit you."::
43347::$$$message_0364_0010_0008$$$::"It isn't a tic, Shaggy."::
43348::$$$message_0364_0011_0000$$$::"Taiga, Kotomine is telling us to be as selfish as we want and have our way with the others."::
43349::$$$message_0364_0011_0001$$$::"Really? Huh.[lr]::
43350::$$$message_0364_0011_0002$$$::Anyway, Illya, why's Shaggy making that face?"::
43351::$$$message_0364_0011_0003$$$::"It's like something unlucky happened to him.[lr]::
43352::$$$message_0364_0011_0004$$$::Like he dropped his wallet, or didn't get to show up in the main story at all."::
43353::$$$message_0364_0011_0005$$$::"..."::
43354::$$$message_0364_0011_0006$$$::"Shh! Don't say that, Taiga. You shouldn't talk about people like that in front of them."::
43355::$$$message_0364_0011_0007$$$::"That's just Kotomine's resting face. He's always gloomy. You can tell from a glance that he's the mastermind. His mullet always gets all shaggy no matter what product he uses on it."::
43356::$$$message_0364_0011_0008$$$::"Not that anyone cares, given his personality."::
43357::$$$message_0364_0011_0009$$$::"..."::
43358::$$$message_0364_0011_0010$$$::"See? It looks like it does bother him a little. We should drop this topic."::
43359::$$$message_0364_0011_0011$$$::"Ohhh. I thought we could bond over being the butt of jokes, but I guess I'd better stop."::
43360::$$$message_0364_0011_0012$$$::"Yeah, it must really suck to get infected with the no-screen-time fungus."::
43361::$$$message_0364_0011_0013$$$::"...Is that all you had to say?[lr]::
43362::$$$message_0364_0011_0014$$$::Then leave promptly. I'm sure I don't need to explain the rules to you."::
43363::$$$message_0364_0011_0015$$$::"As you've shown me about yourselves, you simply need to roam the city and pick fights with other Masters as you see fit."::
43364::$$$message_0364_0011_0016$$$::"Sir, yes sir![lr]::
43365::$$$message_0364_0011_0017$$$::I like the way you think!"::
43366::$$$message_0364_0012_0000$$$::"I knew you'd see it my way, Father![lr]::
43367::$$$message_0364_0012_0001$$$::We've only spoken for a few minutes, but you totally get me!"::
43368::$$$message_0364_0012_0002$$$::"You give me too much credit.[lr]::
43369::$$$message_0364_0012_0003$$$::I am skilled at reading people due to the nature of my job, but I can't appraise something that has no value."::
43370::$$$message_0364_0012_0004$$$::"Zero times any number is still zero.[lr]::
43371::$$$message_0364_0012_0005$$$::I would never claim to take your measure."::
43372::$$$message_0364_0012_0006$$$::"Aw, shucks. You're making me blush."::
43373::$$$message_0364_0012_0007$$$::"Hmm. Actually, you're not half bad-looking.[br]::
43374::$$$message_0364_0012_0008$$$::I think my heart might skip a beat."::
43375::$$$message_0364_0013_0000$$$::"Why don't we go out for a drink sometime, as fellow bit players with no screen time?"::
43376::$$$message_0364_0013_0001$$$::"Also, I wanna shave that mullet."::
43377::$$$message_0364_0013_0002$$$::"Hahaha. Hahahaha. Hahahahahahahahahaha."::
43378::$$$message_0364_0014_0000$$$::"If I may, miss...[lr]::
43379::$$$message_0364_0014_0001$$$::An unmarried woman should not say such things in jest."::
43380::$$$message_0364_0014_0002$$$::"Wow... Kotomine's squeezing his fists so hard they're bleeding..."::
43381::$$$message_0364_0015_0000$$$::"Has anyone given him such a hard time before? I think not."::
43382::$$$message_0364_0015_0001$$$::"Now, although this has been a most charming conversation, we shouldn't waste any more time."::
43383::$$$message_0364_0015_0002$$$::"There is an easily defeated Master at the Emiya residence.[lr]::
43384::$$$message_0364_0015_0003$$$::Why don't you go test your skills there?"::
43385::$$$message_0364_0015_0004$$$::"Hey, thanks for the tip.[lr]::
43386::$$$message_0364_0015_0005$$$::We'll make it count."::
43387::$$$message_0364_0016_0000$$$::[hffacechg chara=藤ねえ face=楽 layer=1 time=200]"Illya, are you ready?"::
43388::$$$message_0364_0016_0001$$$::"Yeah. I already decided to hit that place first. I didn't need Kotomine to tell us."::
43389::$$$message_0364_0016_0002$$$::"All right, then! Let's go!"::
43390::$$$message_0364_0017_0000$$$::"See ya later, Father! I'll invite you to the party once we get the Holy Grail!"::
43391::$$$message_0364_0017_0001$$$::"You heard her. Sometimes I wonder if my Servant is greedy or not. Until we meet again, Father."::
43392::$$$message_0364_0017_0002$$$::"Hm. I'll be waiting, but my expectations are low."[nolr][p]::
43393::$$$message_0364_0017_0003$$$::"So we're going to Shirou's house first."::
43394::$$$message_0364_0018_0000$$$::"We know where we're headed, so let's go crash the place like an out-of-control dump truck."::
43395::$$$message_0364_0018_0001$$$::"Agreed. I'm a tiger, so it doesn't matter to me if Shirou's a little brother to me or not. Still, I think I'd rather settle things there first."::
43396::$$$message_0364_0018_0002$$$::"In fact, now's the time to make him pay for disrespecting his big sister!"::
43397::$$$message_0364_0018_0003$$$::"Well said."::
43398::$$$message_0364_0019_0000$$$::"Yes, all in the name of making Shirou learn his place... [l][hffacechg chara=ブルマイリヤ face=ふっ2 layer=0 time=200][play storage=bgm04.ogg][say storage=HSTR1_BIR_0770 _name=ブルマイリヤ]But before that, why don't we have a warmup?"::
43399::$$$message_0364_0019_0001$$$::"Hm? What's up, Illya? You're scaring me a little."::
43400::$$$message_0364_0020_0000$$$::"Is your love getting twisted into a murderous rage?"::
43401::$$$message_0364_0020_0001$$$::"Yes. I try to simply enjoy games for what they are."::
43402::$$$message_0364_0021_0000$$$::"Isn't that right? Stop hiding and come out, seaweed."::
43403::$$$message_0364_0021_0001$$$::"Heh... Not bad, girl.[lr]::
43404::$$$message_0364_0021_0002$$$::I'd expect nothing less from a chosen Master. You look like a joke, but it seems you're a first-rate mage beneath it all."::
43405::$$$message_0364_0021_0003$$$::"But too bad. Your screen time ends here, even if you did come all the way to Japan."::
43406::$$$message_0364_0021_0004$$$::"Because...I'll be taking your Servant."::
43407::$$$message_0364_0021_0005$$$::"Now, hand over the reins to your Servant if you don't want to get hurt."::
43408::$$$message_0364_0021_0006$$$::"Hm? You know this kid, Illya? He's weirdly pale."::
43409::$$$message_0364_0021_0007$$$::"I have no idea who he is. I bet his purpose is to get stomped. They didn't even color him."[fg textoff=0 left=476 index=1000 top=572 time=300 storage=023_notice]::
43410::$$$message_0364_0022_0000$$$::"It's like a tutorial.[lr]::
43411::$$$message_0364_0022_0001$$$::He barely has any lines, so we could just ignore him."::
43412::$$$message_0364_0022_0002$$$::"Oh, he's just a passerby! Then we don't have to feel bad about kicking his butt!"::
43413::$$$message_0364_0022_0003$$$::"Thank goodness! He looks like one of my students, but that would really have been a shock because the kid is so nice!"::
43414::$$$message_0364_0022_0004$$$::"It's [font italic=true]totally[font italic=false] him, [hfchance layer=0]you good-for-nothing teacher![lr]::
43415::$$$message_0364_0022_0005$$$::And are you implying that you attack random people on the street!?"::
43416::$$$message_0364_0022_0006$$$::"...What are you doing here anyway, Fujimura? A minor character like you should just stay home and eat mandarins at the Fujimura mansion that they didn't even draw."::
43417::$$$message_0364_0022_0007$$$::"My business is with the little lady there. I don't have time to waste on some middle-aged hag."::
43418::$$$message_0364_0022_0008$$$::"Ahahahaha. Hey Illya, can we farm this guy for drops?"::
43419::$$$message_0364_0022_0009$$$::"Sure, whatever you want.[lr]::
43420::$$$message_0364_0022_0010$$$::It'll be a good warmup. Show him your power."::
43421::$$$message_0364_0022_0011$$$::"Roger that! Heh, watch out, baby. If you watch me fight up close, you might just end up becoming my student."::
43422::$$$message_0364_0022_0012$$$::"...? Wait, [font italic=true]you're[font italic=false] going to attack [font italic=true]me[font italic=false]? This has nothing to do with you."::
43423::$$$message_0364_0023_0000$$$::"This is a Holy Grail War, isn't it? There's no place here for a physically abusive teacher."::
43424::$$$message_0364_0023_0001$$$::"Hehehehehe. I'm not that perfect teacher Taiga Fujimura, oh no!"::
43425::$$$message_0364_0024_0000$$$::[hfchance layer=1][se storage=se325.wav]"I am a tigress! A beastly Heroic Spirit who eats people to satisfy her desires!"::
43426::$$$message_0364_0024_0001$$$::"That's insane! Hey girl, is [font italic=true]she[font italic=false] your Servant!? For real? You aren't bullshitting me?"::
43427::$$$message_0364_0024_0002$$$::"Ugh, I don't need this!"::
43428::$$$message_0364_0024_0003$$$::"Awww! I won't order you to line up overnight to buy merch for me anymore,[hfwww layer=0] so come back, Rider!!!"[nolr][p]::

